+prometheus-alertmanager (0.29.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
+
+  freshdeb: this Alertmanager is built like upstream's release binaries,
+  so unlike the distributions' packages it includes the web UI (served on
+  port 9093, as with upstream), the Jira receiver and the event recorder's
+  Kafka output. The UI is built in: generate-ui.sh is gone, and
+  --web.ui-path is accepted but ignored, so existing settings in ARGS keep
+  working.
+
+  Alertmanager 0.27 removed the old /api/v1 API; those endpoints now answer
+  with HTTP 410. The Prometheus versions these distributions ship already
+  send alerts to /api/v2, and so do amtool and the web UI, but other tools
+  that still call /api/v1 need updating.
+
+  Silences and the notification log in /var/lib/prometheus/alertmanager
+  and the configuration in /etc/prometheus/alertmanager.yml are kept.
+
+ -- freshdeb <packages@freshdeb.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
+
